            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.3.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tha 3:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno, calu ni kum ng’atu acel dubo mondo i ng’om man tho ni kum dubo, e kumeno tho kadhu ba dhanu ceke, kum kagi ceke gidubo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kum ka fodi cik kular uwok ungo nwang’u dubo ni i ng’om; ento dubo kwandre ngo ka cik umbe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento tho bimo ugambre kum Adamu cil kum Musa, cil wi ju ma kudubo ngo ku wagi dubo p’Adamu ma en e ayi pa ng’atu ma bibino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento giramia mananu bedo calu kier ungo. Kum tek ni kum kier pa ng’atu acel dhanu dupa tho, ma sagu apila bero pa Mungu, man giramia ma ni kum bero pa ng’atu acel, en e Kristu Yesu, usagre ni dhanu dupa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man calu ni kum ng’atu acel m’udubo e giramia bedo kumeni ngo: kum lembapoka bino ba ng’atu acel ni gonj ma jugonjo ko jo, ento giramia mananu wok kum kier ma dupa ni tic mi bedopwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum tek, ni kum kier pa ng’atu acel nica, tho bimo ni kum ng’atu acel; e ju ma gijolo sagri mi bero man mi giramia mi bedopwe e ma gibibimo bim i kwo ma sagu dit ni kum ng’atu acel, en e Yesu Kristu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno calu ni kum kier acel lembapoka wok ni dhanu ceke ni gonj ma jugonjo ko jo; cil kumeno ni kum tic acel mi bedopwe giramia mananu wok ni dhanu ceke ni gony mi kwo ma jugonyo ko lembe ma wi jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum ni kum camuco pa ng’atu acel judwoko dhanu dupa ni judubo, cil kumeno ni kum woro pa ng’atu acel jubidwoko dhanu dupa pwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man cik de bino umedo maeca, kara kier usagre; ento ka ma dubo sagre i ie, e bero sagre dit apila: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kara, calu dubo bimo bim i tho, cil kumeno bero ubim bim ni kum bedopwe ni kwo ma rondo ku rondo ni kum Yesu Kristu Rwoth mwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.5.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
